Subject: Visitor pass for {{visitorName}}
<h1>Visitor pass</h1>
<p>{{t "greeting"}} {{residentName}},</p>
<p><strong>{{visitorName}}</strong> is expected at {{communityName}}. Share this gate pass code:</p>
<p style="font-size:24px;letter-spacing:4px;"><strong>{{passCode}}</strong></p>
{{#if expectedAt}}<p class="muted">Expected {{expectedAt}}</p>{{/if}}
